## Ignore Atmel Studio temporary files and build results
# https://www.microchip.com/mplab/avr-support/atmel-studio-7

# Atmel Studio is powered by an older version of Visual Studio,
# so most of the project and solution files are the same as VS files,
# only prefixed by an `at`.

#Build Directories
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/

#Build Results
*.o
*.d
*.eep
*.elf
*.hex
*.map
*.srec

#User Specific Files
*.atsuo

#Jlink log & config files
*.log
*.config 

#Secret header file
secret.h

# no source files allowed in final repo
*.c
*.h

# Claude Code - local only, never push
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.agents/
skills-lock.json

# Wrangler CLI cache
.wrangler/

# Screenshots & temp files
screenshots/
scripts/
temp_screenshot.txt
*.png
!docs/assets/**/*.png